{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-2", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "命定的終點", "storyInfo": "萊娜回到雅賽努斯，希望能在故鄉建立感染者醫療體系，為此她想去尋求幫助，卻遭到一位故人的阻攔。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g7_firsttemple", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "效仿英雄海格斯比腕力……還真的讓工人和果農冷靜下來溝通了？你很聰明，緹緹。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但帕拉斯小姐其實昨晚就想出了解決問題的方法，只是太過勞累栽倒在蘋果箱裡睡著了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜了你釀的蘋果酒……原來是打算用來招待工人和果農，酒酣之後再讓他們合作採石的，對嗎？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。不過用它來招待客人，也不可惜啊。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_winebottle_open"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不是還在暈船嗎？來，乾杯，剛好用我的酒來緩解！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "50,0", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-50,0", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_pourwine"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "posfrom": "-50,0", "posto": "-50,0", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "乾杯！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$clink"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "50,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "-50,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈……甜甜的，真好喝！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯小姐，雖然最終我們的想法不謀而合，但請你誠實地告訴我，我擅自插手第一神殿的重建工作，是不是不太恰當？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為你是薩爾貢的大使？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為薩爾貢曾經——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，你只需要回答我一個問題——你認為白鬃王帕赫里圖出兵征服米諾斯是否有其必要？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使那樣做可以轉嫁薩爾貢國內的矛盾？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#15$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帝國內部的矛盾，就應該在帝國內部解決才對。轉嫁給無辜的鄰國是他的無能！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#15$2"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然回到薩爾貢之後，我多半就不敢說得這麼直接了……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈！爽快，來，喝酒！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1", "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我原以為像你這樣隨性又異想天開的人，對待歷史問題不會如此尖銳。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要你剛剛的回答是出自真心，而不是出於人身安全考慮準備的說辭，那我們就能成為朋友。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯小姐——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對朋友還用敬稱？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯，我認為入鄉隨俗也不能忘了自己的身分。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然佩佩——我在薩爾貢的朋友，總說我的想法跳躍，行事風格也不合常理，但這是兩碼事！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來薩爾貢的帕夏選中你擔任使節團的負責人，還是蠻有眼光的……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心吧，工人和果農都很喜歡你。我們有辨別宵小之徒的經驗，不至於遷怒每個薩爾貢人。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#15$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且在現在這個節骨眼，只要能解決問題，單純參與第一神殿的重建工作也不算是越界。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#15$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……這話怎麼說？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看啊，這神殿內的立柱、浮雕、紋飾大多都還沒有完工；神殿外的露天劇場從第三排開始就看不見舞台了，坡度根本沒有調整……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有矗立在劇場中央的克瑞斯拉雕像，因為雕塑家的完美主義，到現在仍在進行最終收尾，不算正式完工。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這個進度有點……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“讓人頭大”。不用斟酌詞句，又不是寫詩——所有人都知道建造進度已經遠遠落後於預期。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "來，先喝酒。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l,r"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖說重建神殿沒有工期限制，就算為了追求完美而導致效率不高，終究也是能完工的，但現在看來，再拖下去各方人員都會受到影響。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "果農們的採收……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。再有下次就不是幾局比腕力跟一瓶好酒能解決的囉……喝得這麼快？再幫你倒一杯？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝！可是帕拉斯，我有個問題想問。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明明你幫工匠解決了不少問題，他們也很依賴你，但身為計劃負責人，你怎麼看起來一點都不著急？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？我從來都不是神殿重建計劃的負責人啊。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什、什麼？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“效仿古法”代表整個計劃只需要一位祭司——也就是卡珊卓拉小姐負責帶領，正式執行階段根本不會指定負責人。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是一名好事又好酒的閒散人士，怎麼可能當什麼負責人，不過……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#15$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我看你倒是通情達理，腦筋轉得也很快。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#15$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_shy", "layer": 1.0, "x": 250.0, "y": 150.0}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "（暢快地飲酒）哈哈……"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "你剛剛在說什麼？我好像沒聽清楚……"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒什麼。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，怎麼一瓶酒已經見底了？你的酒量不錯啊，我私釀的酒度數不低耶。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#7$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不對勁……帕、帕拉斯，你不是說這個酒能緩解暈船嗎……？我怎麼越喝越暈了？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#7$2"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，暈酒比暈水還好吧？喝完了倒頭大睡，什麼事都能解決，更何況暈船？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$bodyfalldown1", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,-30", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.8, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_courtyard", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_181_flower_1#6$1", "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對不起，父親，母親。我感染了礦石病。你們的事業當然不會允許一個感染者來繼承，現在，我可以做自己想做的事了吧？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_181_flower_1#6$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道我不能繼續留在家裡了，我會儘快搬出去，不必為我擔心，我已經完全有能力照顧自己了，也不會為家族添麻煩的。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_181_flower_1#6$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_181_flower_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果可以的話，能請你們留下我的花園嗎？只是一些植物而已，礦石病是不會穢染它們的潔淨的。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_181_flower_1#8$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_181_flower_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請容我告辭了。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_181_flower_1#2$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g10_templegarden", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$path_intro", "key": "$path_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "很久沒有回雅賽努斯，我不會走錯路了吧？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "廣場西側的公共花園……應該沒錯。卡珊卓拉小姐還沒到嗎？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1", "focus": "none"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐是雅賽努斯議事廳成員，怎麼可能在公共場合跟羅德島製藥的人私下會面呢？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你離家太久，關於這裡的事都忘得差不多了啊，姐姐。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭？約我見面的人是你？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好久不見，我聽說你當上了雅賽努斯的理事官？本來想找你敘舊，但籌備羅德島辦事處花費了太多時間——", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道，你回雅賽努斯的這兩個月為感染者做了不少事，連回家的空閒都很難擠出來。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭，我並不打算回家，他們……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心吧，就算回到莊園，你也見不到那些虛榮的家族成員了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩年前，阿蘇普歐洛家族宣告破產，不再做草藥相關的生意，僅剩的家族成員也已經搬離雅賽努斯了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來是這樣……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來你確實不在乎了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "值得留戀的事太少，我對莊園的回憶只剩下我的花園。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小時候，你的母親常帶你來花園找我玩，後來她因病過世……你就寄養在我家。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在花園裡，我教你栽種、調香、辨認植物。你對它們一點興趣都沒有，但還是陪我種下淡藍色的波羅尼，就跟這座花壇裡的一樣……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以我說，你真的都忘了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，這座公共花園……！", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡就是那塊你用來研究種植和草藥的小花圃。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在我當上理事官後不久，你的父母為了抵債，就把這塊私人用地賣給雅賽努斯政府了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你以為他們至少會守護你的心血？連自己的親生女兒都能驅逐，他們又怎麼會顧及一個微不足道的請求？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭……你跟以前不一樣了。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你也一樣。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拜訪感染者、聯絡負責醫藥的神殿祭司，甚至想到要接觸卡珊卓拉小姐，確保感染者對傳統英雄氣概的推崇不會成為治療的阻礙。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以前你最不擅長的就是應付流程，而現在你學會了繞開城市行政體系中尚在角力的部分，繞開我這個新任的理事官。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白了。你找我來根本不是為了敘舊，而是想阻礙我跟祭司們接觸，為了——", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把建立並維持感染者醫療體系的權力從雅賽努斯議事廳手中奪走，收歸到理事官的權責中。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你很瞭解。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "貪權的政府官員，羅德島接觸過不少。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "走訪也好，發藥也罷，只要是羅德島製藥私下的行為，我都不會過問。就算不經過理事官首肯，萊娜小姐你也已經開始這麼做了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但想必你也感受到了，第一神殿重建、薩爾貢使節團到訪，甚至是建立感染者醫療體系，都代表米諾斯必將發生變化。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米諾斯眾英雄的傳說是流淌在我們身體裡的血，但傳統同樣帶來了冗雜的政體、不合理的制度，還有守舊的思想。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是最清楚的，不是嗎？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我很想說，只要不影響我的病人，保證感染者醫療體系能順利建成，理事官小姐你打算怎麼做都可以。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你是家族中我唯一還在乎的人，是我的妹妹。里底婭，無論如何我都不希望你做危險的事。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，薩爾貢使節團的大使？不過就是個不諳世事的小妹妹，還真樂呵呵地去參觀第一神殿重建現場了。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也好，剛好拿她做幌子探探那個理事官。交換儀式延後？說不定她是在為自己的小心思故意拖延，如果真的是故意怠慢使節團……", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "來人！準備一下，我們去理事官辦公室。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "迷茫的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是誰家的小孩子，怎麼亂跑進來了？護衛！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#9$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，尊敬的大使先生，這是我的旅伴。我們從科林尼亞和拉刻代蒙遠道而來，應邀觀禮。", "name": "面善的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#9$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她對薩爾貢文化充滿熱情，聽說使節團負責人在此下榻，非要來一睹大使真容，我根本阻止不了她。", "name": "面善的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#9$1"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "迷茫的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1"}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大使……咳……兩位年輕人眼光不錯。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，應邀觀禮？我還沒聽里底婭理事官提過這個安排，兩國文物交換儀式的場地還沒定下來吧？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，是我多嘴，想必里底婭小姐是想給使節團一個驚喜。", "name": "面善的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是來自科林尼亞的祭司佩里安德洛斯，早在半年之前就聽聞會有使節團到訪雅賽努斯。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "半年前？這麼早？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，薩爾貢和米諾斯氣候環境差距極大，為了讓各位賓至如歸，里底婭小姐特地聯絡我，請科林尼亞的商人採購薩爾貢製品。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡的貴賓客房，您住得是否舒服呢？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，原來這是佩里安德洛斯先生的手筆。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除客房之外，里底婭小姐為了儀式也是盡心盡力。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜，有幾批用於製作戲劇服裝的珍貴布匹遲遲沒有送到卡珊卓拉祭司的手裡，耽誤了不少時間，她可曾提過？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "戲劇……里底婭理事官確實提過，重要的場合均會安排一齣戲劇。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，卡珊卓拉祭司是哪位？我以為理事官的意思是此事由她的辦公室全權負責籌備？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，幸好大使先生提醒我，我差點誤解了理事官的意思！怪不得她特地囑咐，不要選用製作古典戲劇服裝的傳統布匹。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這次的布料選用的棉花是薩爾貢和米諾斯的雜交品種，紡出的布匹柔韌光滑，寓意著兩國長久和睦，所以里底婭小姐堅持要等。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來是這樣，所以里底婭理事官才說要延後交換儀式……", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "延後？那真是我們的疏忽，耽誤了大使先生的行程。但願您不會誤解里底婭小姐的用心良苦。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#4$1"}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好說。既然她如此認真地操辦儀式，那我要是再三催促反而失了禮數，多謝提醒。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您太客氣了。大使先生不如在城中逛逛，靜待幾日後的交換儀式即可。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g4_athenusstreet", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "迷茫的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別這樣看我嘛，今天一大早我還陪你逛了三圈美食市場，現在換你陪我，不委屈吧？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你剛剛的說辭有幾句真話？", "name": "迷茫的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢使節團進城，里底婭理事官邀請我們觀禮，卻又不告訴我們她的安排，那我只能自己打探了。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過我也幫她打消了對方的顧慮，不是嗎？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1"}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……要是做事只談回報，科林尼亞的商人想必也不會聞名泰拉了。", "name": "迷茫的遊客"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎呀，說破就不禮貌了哦。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1"}, {"id": 344, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}